### Create Our Process stage 1: Scope and process capture
POST {{apiUrl}}/posts
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Scope and process capture",
  "slug": "scope-and-process-capture",
  "content": "<p>We document the work as it is done today &mdash; volumes, tools, SLAs, escalation rules and the edge cases your current team keeps in their heads.</p>",
  "excerpt": "We document the work as it is done today &mdash; volumes, tools, SLAs, escalation rules and the edge cases your current team keeps in their heads.",
  "status": "publish",
  "categories": [{{ourProcessCategoryId}}],
  "featured_media": {{scopeProcessMediaId}},
  "acf": {
    "number": 1
  }
}

